# Alert icons: stop, caution, note.
# Derivation: octagon cut and 2:1 triangle slope match the user's own procedural
# stopSign()/caution() in M5Tab-Macintosh preboot_ui.cpp, and the note keeps its idea of a
# rounded balloon with a blue "i"; the hand, bevels, glyphs and tail are drawn new.
# Original RetroBoot pixel art, drawn from scratch for rbui in the
# spirit of Mac OS 8/9 Platinum; no Apple bitmaps were copied or traced.
# One character per pixel; letters come from palette.txt, "." is transparent.

# Red octagon, raised white hand with a dark-red drop shadow.
